INSERT INTO `countrytours_faq` VALUES (33,15,'{\"time\":1763393197489,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"zsTyhWe4gM\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 8:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763393197489,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"zxUXjKX-U-\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"As it\'s your last morning in Nepal before you bid farewell to Nepal, for one last time relish the cuisines of Nepal in morning breakfast. Check out and head towards Kathmandu airport/railway station. As this trip comes to an end, wrap your heart in Nepal\'s beauty as your journey concludes. Hoping the magic of Nepal made your holiday truly special.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 15:26:38','2025-11-17 15:26:38'),(34,15,'{\"time\":1763393230579,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"_KJbUU-SVy\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 7:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763393230579,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"psEdadh62C\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"After breakfast, return back to the capital, Kathmandu (5-7 hours). Arrive and check in at the hotel; later visit Pashupatinath Temple, an ancient Hindu temple dedicated to Lord Shiva. One of the twelve Jyotirlingas, which is located outside India. In the evening enjoy exploring local cuisines and markets of Nepal. Unwind for a relaxing overnight stay in Kathmandu.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 15:27:10','2025-11-17 15:27:10'),(35,15,'{\"time\":1763393265815,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"7xWW3dmhfJ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 6:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763393265815,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"7HFv1JAlpy\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Wake up early in the morning for a short picturesque drive to Sarangkot to witness the breathtaking views of the Himalayas as the sun rises. Watch this golden hour as the sun rises and illuminates the peaks of Annapurna, Dhaulagiri, and Machhapuchhre, a sight so breathtaking. It will leave you awestruck. Return to your hotel for breakfast and then set out to explore more of Pokhara\'s beauty; visit the famous World Peace Stupa with panoramic lake views. Later, visit Ghupteshwor Mahadev Cave and Seti River Gorge, and learn about Nepal\'s mountaineering history by visiting the International Mountain Museum. Unwind for a relaxing overnight stay at Pokhara.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 15:27:46','2025-11-17 15:27:46'),(36,15,'{\"time\":1763393306233,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"ErV2d6nk0d\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 5:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763393306233,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"snXwrkXCAv\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Wake up to another beautiful morning in nature\'s retreat, enjoy your breakfast, and then start your journey to your next stop, Pokhara (4-5 hours). Arrive and check in at the hotel. In the evening explore the majestic beauty of the Machhapuchhre (Fish Tail Peak) and Annapurna ranges reflected in Phewa Lake. Enjoy your overnight stay at Pokhara.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 15:28:26','2025-11-17 15:28:26'),(37,15,'{\"time\":1763393347407,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"8FPzwv_YR2\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 4:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763393347407,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"ks8TfBVUJt\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"As you wake up in the lap of nature with the gentle sounds of nature, the chirping of birds, and freshness in the air. Start your day as you set out for an early morning safari and enjoy various jungle activities like bird watching and nature walks. Return to your resort for breakfast and gear up for another day full of adventure: experience more jungle activities like elephant briefing, canoe ride (as per weather conditions), village walk, and Tharu cultural dance performance, and an exhilarating half-day jeep ride through Chitwan National Park, home of Bengal tigers, one-horned rhinoceroses, and countless bird species. You will have the best jungle experience. Enjoy your overnight stay at Chitwan.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 15:29:08','2025-11-17 15:29:08'),(38,15,'{\"time\":1763393382658,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"SYDr8enQXy\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 3:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763393382658,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"qDMDfBiXg7\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"After enjoying your wholesome breakfast, begin the travel trail of another beautiful day as you drive to Chitwan (6-7 hours), a journey through misty mountain landscapes and lush green landscapes. Make the most out of this Pinterest-worthy drive upon arrival in Chitwan, check in to your jungle lodge, and relish your lunch. Later enjoy your jungle activities and take a glimpse of the flora and fauna of Nepal. Feel the thrill as the forest comes alive around you. Enjoy your overnight stay at Chitwan.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 15:29:42','2025-11-17 15:29:42'),(39,15,'{\"time\":1763393426073,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"X-E5O360hu\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 2:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763393426073,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"IsikfvWKp6\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"After a wholesome breakfast, start your scenic drive to Nagarkot (1-2 hours), a hilltop retreat known for panoramic Himalayan vistas.&nbsp; En route, step back in time and visit some of the ancient cities of Patan City and Bhaktapur, where every brick, every nook, and every corner narrates stories of Nepal\'s ancient history. Wander through ancient temples appreciating their intricate beauty. Visit the National Museum and learn more about Nepal\'s history, culture, art, and history. As you get closer to Nagarkot, feel the air grow cooler and the landscape more serene. In the evening, stroll through the local markets before unwinding for a relaxing overnight stay in Nagarkot.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 15:30:26','2025-11-17 15:30:26'),(40,15,'{\"time\":1763393460697,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"CNpCmr47hY\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 1:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763393460697,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"ddyDmXlw-9\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Arrive at Kathmandu airport/railway station, head towards your private vehicle, meet TrippyJiffy\'s representative, and transfer to your hotel. Check in to the hotel. In the afternoon after lunch, visit the famous Sowayambhunath Stupa: Swayambhunath is one of the oldest and most revered religious sites in Nepal, believed to have been established around the 5th century. Its name means â€œSelf-Existent Oneâ€ in Sanskrit. Perched atop a hill in western Kathmandu, it offers breathtaking views of the entire valley, especially at sunrise and sunset. In the evening, stroll through the vibrant streets of Indra Chowk, soaking in the local charm and culture, before unwinding for a relaxing overnight stay in Kathmandu.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 15:31:00','2025-11-17 15:31:00'),(41,16,'{\"time\":1763396123171,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"OfvhWaXu45\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 10:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763396123171,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"2jwTC2qdwu\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"After breakfast, bid farewell to your most wholesome trip to Thailand. This itinerary had a&nbsp;perfect blend of leisure, excitement, and rich cultural experience in every step.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 16:15:23','2025-11-17 16:15:23'),(42,16,'{\"time\":1763396169507,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"gOSdZHaYpQ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 9:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763396169507,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"MIfc9mJh1r\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"After breakfast enjoy your day at your own pace since this is your leisure dayâ€”a free day for you to explore the city in your own version to create your own story. Explore Bangkok\'s famous Indira market for shopping, clothing, souvenirs, and accessories. In the evening head towards your hotel for an overnight stay in Bangkok.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 16:16:09','2025-11-17 16:16:09'),(43,16,'{\"time\":1763396201911,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"HqwkZ9bkvi\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 8:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763396201911,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"TVrHPJln-v\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"After breakfast start another day of exploration with a Bangkok city tour. Visit the famous Golden Buddha: home of the world\'s largest solid gold Buddha, weighing about 5.5 tons. Mahaputaram Temple: A respected Buddhist temple known for its sacred worship and local religious traditions. Gems Gallery: Thailandâ€™s well-known showcase for gemstones, jewelry craftsmanship, and shopping experience. Enjoy your comfortable overnight stay in Bangkok.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 16:16:42','2025-11-17 16:16:42'),(44,16,'{\"time\":1763396245092,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"fTv1FX4wLj\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 7:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763396245092,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"07QTLWgOaz\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"After breakfast transfer from the Krabi hotel to Phuket Airport. Take your flight to Bangkok; upon arrival in Bangkok, meet your TrippyJiffy representative, who will help you with the check-in process at the Bangkok hotel. In the evening, brace yourself for an exotic experience. Dinner at cruiseâ€”Chao Phraya Cruise on PVT basis (INTERNATIONAL FOOD) A scenic cruise along the â€œRiver of Kings,â€ offering iconic views like Wat Arun lit at night. Enjoy your comfortable overnight stay in Bangkok.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 16:17:25','2025-11-17 16:17:25'),(45,16,'{\"time\":1763396284937,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"UOIBRtohVc\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 6:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763396284937,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"lSobDmHlyQ\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"After breakfast start another day witnessing the beauty of Krabi on the Four Island Tour on the longtail boat with lunch (local Thai food). Enjoy visiting 4 Islands: Chicken Island, Poda Island, Tup Island, and Phra Nang Cave beach, which is famous for snorkeling, sandbars, and the sacred Princess Cave. In the evening head towards the hotel and enjoy your comfortable overnight stay at Krabi.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 16:18:05','2025-11-17 16:18:05'),(46,16,'{\"time\":1763396325462,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"UQoSdhVGgV\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 5:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763396325462,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"eMZJNKz6I8\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"After breakfast head towards your private vehicle for your transfer to your Krabi hotel; en route enjoy a Krabi city tour. Explore Nopparat Thara Beach: A peaceful beach lined with casuarina trees, a perfect place to witness sunset views near Ao Nang. Black Crab Sculpture: It\'s a popular landmark that signifies Krabi\'s preserved marine life, located near the riverside. Lastly, visit Mangrove Forest: A lush green waterwayâ€”enjoy the scenic boat ride through the mangroves. Check in at the Krabi hotel and enjoy your comfortable overnight stay at Krabi.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 16:18:45','2025-11-17 16:18:45'),(47,16,'{\"time\":1763396360386,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"v4GzXZ4Orm\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 4:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763396360386,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"x-WgviqLFE\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"After breakfast enjoy your day at your own pace since this is your leisure dayâ€”a free day for you to explore the city in your own version to create your own story. Explore Phuket\'s vibrant markets, beaches, water sports, and vibrant cafes. In the evening head towards your hotel for an overnight stay in Phuket.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 16:19:20','2025-11-17 16:19:20'),(48,16,'{\"time\":1763396404123,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"CRXrkpZvDd\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 3:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763396404123,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"hDGPuBspJv\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"After breakfast, start another day witnessing the beauty of Phi Phi Island. Enjoy the speedboat ride with lunch (on a sharing basis) and enjoy the beautiful Phi Phi Island tour. Enjoy snorkeling (at your expense) if you are an adventure lover and witness the beauty of crystal-clear waters and dramatic limestone cliffs. Enjoy a complete day at Phi Phi Island, and in the evening head towards your hotel for an overnight stay in Phuket.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 16:20:04','2025-11-17 16:20:04'),(49,16,'{\"time\":1763396449874,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"TdRUVTPuKn\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day2:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763396449874,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"Md5PqR0HI6\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"After breakfast head towards your private vehicle and begin your Phuket City Tour. Start by visiting Chalong Temple (Wat Chalong): one of Phuketâ€™s most sacred Buddhist temples, dedicated to revered monks Luang Pho Chaem &amp; Luang Pho Chuang. Kata Karon Patong Viewpointâ€”Famous viewpoint offering a panoramic view of Phuketâ€™s three most iconic beaches. Phuket Old Townâ€”Known for its Sino-Portuguese architecture, colorful shophouses, and vibrant street art. Honey Farm â€“ Showcases Thailandâ€™s local honey production and bee conservation techniques. Cashew Nut Factoryâ€”Learn how Phuket\'s cashews are processed and about the uniqueness of their flavors. Dolphin Showâ€”Witness the cuteness of dolphins as they perform playful stunts. Tiger Kingdomâ€”Experience the wildness come alive as you interact and take photos with tigers under safety supervision. After a fun-filled day of exploring and enjoying such different activities, head towards your hotel to enjoy a comfortable overnight stay.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 16:20:50','2025-11-17 16:20:50'),(50,16,'{\"time\":1763396482120,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"LHz7tU8DOl\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day1:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763396482121,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"1pz0_JHpYp\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Arrival in Phuket and transfer to your Phuket hotel on a private basis. Meet your TrippyJiffy representative at the airport, who will brief you about your trip timings and details.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 16:21:22','2025-11-17 16:21:22'),(51,17,'{\"time\":1763396775012,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"2qQ2goBHWc\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 5:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763396775013,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"CNDNZ--qY_\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Private transfer to Dubai International Airport for departure after breakfast at the hotel and the check-out procedure. This itinerary had a&nbsp;perfect blend of leisure, excitement, and rich cultural experience in every step.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 16:26:15','2025-11-17 16:26:15'),(52,17,'{\"time\":1763396812074,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"T1i7Ugc4G_\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 4:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763396812074,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"TTtHePqpr-\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"After breakfast explore the day at your leisure. Explore the vibrant markets of Dubai, famous for gold items. You can take optional tours with usâ€”Burj Khalifa, Miracle Garden, Global Village, or theme parks. Overnight stay in Dubai.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 16:26:52','2025-11-17 16:26:52'),(53,17,'{\"time\":1763396847976,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"jVGwxxamip\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 3:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763396847977,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"GalLmQRzNC\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"After breakfast proceed for the Abu Dhabi City Tour. Visit Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque: one of the worldâ€™s largest mosques, known for its white marble architecture and grand chandeliers decorated with Swarovski crystals. BAPS Hindu Temple: A beautifully carved traditional Hindu temple built in pink sandstone and white marble, promoting peace and cultural harmony. Corniche: A picturesque seaside promenade featuring pristine beaches, walking paths, and Abu Dhabi skyline views. Heritage Village: A recreated Emirati village showcasing Bedouin lifestyle, crafts, and culture from the UAEâ€™s early history. Emirates Palace (Photo Stop): A luxury landmark hotel symbolizing Arabian royalty with golden interiors and majestic architecture. Return to Dubai in the evening for an overnight stay in Dubai.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 16:27:28','2025-11-17 16:27:28'),(54,17,'{\"time\":1763396884854,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"QoSile-9BA\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 2:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763396884854,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"SxUhOV7oME\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"After breakfast get set for another adventure-filled day for the Dubai City tour. Visit Burj Al Arab: the worldâ€™s most luxurious hotel, designed in the shape of a billowing sail and built on a man-made island. Jumeirah Mosque: One of Dubaiâ€™s most photographed mosques, famous for its stunning white faÃ§ade and â€œOpen Doors, Open Mindsâ€ cultural tours. Atlantis The Palm: An iconic ocean-themed resort located on the Palm Jumeirah, known for Aquaventure Waterpark and marine adventures. Dubai Frame: A towering architectural landmark shaped like a giant frame offering panoramic views of â€œOld Dubaiâ€ and â€œNew Dubai. Gold &amp; Spice Souk: Historic market areas famous for dazzling gold jewelry, aromatic spices, and traditional Middle Eastern products. Refresh yourself by diving into Arabic cuisines after this short break. Brace yourself for another day with a beautiful evening. Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner &amp; Live Performances: A thrilling dune bashing experience with camel rides, a live fire show, Tanoura dance, belly dancing, and BBQ dinner under starry skies. Enjoy your comfortable overnight stay in Dubai.&nbsp;\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 16:28:04','2025-11-17 16:28:04'),(55,17,'{\"time\":1763396914388,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"v9L9D1OzVD\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Day 1:</b>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763396914388,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"WNW9tsI_hf\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Upon arrival at Dubai International Airport, meet TrippyJiffyâ€™s representative and head towards your private vehicle for transfer from airport to hotel. Complete your check-in process. Get ready, as a beautiful evening awaits at Dhow Cruise: enjoy this beautiful evening offering scenic skyline views with live entertainment and dinner on calm evening waters. Enjoy your comfortable overnight stay in Dubai.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-17 16:28:34','2025-11-17 16:28:34');
