ugh Krishnaâ€™s Footstepsâ€ - Mathura & Vrindavan Tour - FAQ','{\"time\":1763129047887,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"Pfxr5Mvm-2\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Routing:</b> Delhi-Mathura-Vrindavan-Delhi<br><br>\"}},{\"id\":\"ulqi7RSDr5\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Duration:</b> 1 day<br><b><br>Tour Info:</b> Embark on the most soulful journey where faith meets culture. Situated on the banks of the River Yamuna, Mathura and Vrindavan echo the divine tales of Krishnaâ€™s life. Here is where the magic unfolds and you witness the spiritual aura like never before. In this tour you will visit the most beautiful temples, each temple taking you back in time, allowing you to experience Lord Krishnaâ€™s divine journey as if it were unfolding right before your eyes.&nbsp;\\n\\nThis one-day spiritual retreat will cleanse your heart and soul, and it\'s an ideal trip for travelers seeking peace and connection with spirituality and heritage.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-14 14:04:07','2025-11-14 14:04:07',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1763129047887,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"dPvZ64YKIw\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[{\"content\":\" Pick &amp; Drop from Delhi Airport/Railway Station.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Sightseeing in a private air-conditioned vehicle is included as per the itinerary.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"1 packed water bottle of 500 ml per person.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Cover the sightseeing or places as per the time availability.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Driverâ€™s allowance, toll parking, road tax, and fuel charges are all included.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"All taxes and fees are included in the package; any other tax as levied by the government shall be extra.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]}]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1763129047887,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"aK8lY2tPx8\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Not Available\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763129047887,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"uAZQZ07uJA\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[{\"content\":\"All flight or train tickets\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Tips for driver.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Any unforeseen events such as change in schedule, cancellation or schedule change of train or flight, any extreme weather conditions, political disturbances, etc.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Any unforeseen event that impacts the itinerary plan will be taken care of by the customers.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Any other item not specified in the package inclusions.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]}]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}'),(46,69,'Experience the Indiaâ€™s Timeless Wondersâ€”Delhi & Agra Await - FAQ','{\"time\":1763129789909,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"IMgBRQBObN\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Routing:</b> Delhi-Agra-Delhi<br><br>\"}},{\"id\":\"y532_qjNrR\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Durationâ€”</b>2 Nights 3 Days<br><br>\"}},{\"id\":\"nWMqeWFuKd\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Tour Infoâ€”</b> Delve into the grandeur beauty of Mughal Marvels and the timeless beauty of the Taj Mahal. Enjoy the charm of Indian history and heritage as you walk down the past and the present. Explore the vibrant streets of Delhi, where the Mughal marvel and the modern charm meet. Explore grand monuments like the Red Fort, Humayun\'s Tomb, Qutub Minar, India Gate, Rashtraparti Bhawan, and Dilli Hatt alongside diving into the aroma of cuisines on the streets of Chandni Chowk, filling the air, and tasting some of the legendary dishes like &nbsp; kebabs, jalebis,and chaat, while learning the stories behind each bite. As the journey moves ahead, explore the history of India, and visit the Agra Fort and the charming Baby Taj (Itmad-ud-Daulah). This itinerary is the perfect blend of Indiaâ€™s history, culture, and comfort.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-14 14:16:29','2025-11-14 14:16:29',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1763129789910,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"yI5XgTjIdT\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[{\"content\":\"Pick &amp; Drop from Delhi Airport/Railway Station.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"English-speaking guide.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Rickshaw ride in Chandni Chowk\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Battery van ride in Agra.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Sightseeing in a private air-conditioned vehicle is included as per the itinerary.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"1 packed water bottle of 500 ml per person.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Driverâ€™s allowance, toll parking, road tax, and fuel charges are all included.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"All taxes and fees are included in the package; any other tax as levied by the government shall be extra.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]}]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1763129789910,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"GkNhBNFQwD\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Not Available\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763129789910,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"ndLDqnSKSp\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[{\"content\":\"All flight or train tickets.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Tips for drivers.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Monument entrance fees during sightseeing.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Any unforeseen events such as change in schedule, cancellation or schedule change of train or flight; any extreme weather conditions; political disturbances; etc.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Any unforeseen event that impacts the itinerary plan will be taken care of by the customers.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Any other item not specified in the package inclusions.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]}]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}'),(47,70,'Experience the Royal Charm of a 2-Night Pink City Getaway from Delhi - FAQ','{\"time\":1763672034217,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"V93pMW4-UB\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Routing:</b> Delhi-Jaipur-Delhi<br><b><br>Durationâ€”&nbsp;</b>2 nights &amp; 3 Days<br><b><br>Tour Info:</b> Unveil the royal charm of the Pink City of India. This journey of 2 nights takes you back in time to witness the Royal Rajputana Legacy through grand forts, the majestic palaces where each room holds a story and each wall has its own significance, the colorful bazaars that light up every womanâ€™s heart, and the timeless Rajasthani culture and food. Explore iconic landmarks like the Amber Fort, City Palace, Hawa Mahal, and Jantar Mantar, while enjoying the vibrant atmosphere and royalty that make Jaipur one of a kind.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-15 05:10:24','2025-11-20 07:23:16',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1763672034220,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"NZenHfijAb\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[{\"content\":\"Pick &amp; drop from Delhi Airport/Railway Station.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"English-speaking guide.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Breakfast Included.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"A stay of 2 nights is included.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Elephant ride in Jaipur.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Chokhi Dhani visits with dinner.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Sightseeing in a private air-conditioned vehicle is included as per the itinerary.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"1 packed water bottle of 500 ml per person.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Driverâ€™s allowance, toll parking, road tax, and fuel charges are all included.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"All taxes and fees are included in the