 in the lap of nature. Here you will witness the beautiful Ganga Aarti at Har Ki Pauri. Explore the calmness of Rishikesh, the Yoga Capital of the World. This journey gives an eternal calm and is a perfect blend of devotion, natureâ€™s beauty, and inner tranquillity. As the trip winds down, it leaves you spiritually uplifted.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-15 05:17:26','2025-11-20 07:22:36',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1763671994386,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"vw_jR5CxZr\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[{\"content\":\"Pick &amp; Drop from Delhi Airport/Railway Station.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Breakfast Included.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Stay of 1 night Included\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Sightseeing in a private air-conditioned vehicle is included as per the itinerary.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"1 packed water bottle of 500 ml per person.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Driverâ€™s allowance, toll parking, road tax, and and fuel charges are all included.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"All taxes and fees are included in the package; any other tax levied by the government shall be extra.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]}]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1763671994386,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"BnjPuwLAxn\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Not Available\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763671994387,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"dW_jBfXet4\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[{\"content\":\"All flight or train tickets.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Tips for drivers.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Monument entrance fees during sightseeing.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Any unforeseen events such as change in schedule, cancellation or schedule change of train or flight; any extreme weather conditions; political &nbsp; etc.\",\"meta