le with Varanasi Tour Package - FAQ','{\"time\":1764314625696,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"NLVcyrQCL9\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Routing:</b>Delhi-Jaipur-Agra-Varanasi-Delhi<br><br>\"}},{\"id\":\"amcyo2aQEH\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Duration:</b> 7 Nights &amp; 8 Days<br><br>\"}},{\"id\":\"uTD51fV5_H\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Tour Overview:</b> India, a country that proudly celebrates its ancient history, rich heritage, and vibrance of secularism. In every 100 kilometers you witness a new culture, unique traditions, each of them deeply rooted in the hearts of its people. This Golden Triangle with Varanasi itinerary will entwine your soul with spirituality and leave you with unforgettable memories to cherish. Varanasi, also known as Kashi, meaning â€œCity of Light,â€ is one of the worldâ€™s oldest continuously inhabited cities, over 3,000 years old. Death in Varanasi is believed to grant moksha, ending the cycle of rebirth. The vibrant culture and timeless customs of India will touch your heart in ways you have never experienced before.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-15 05:36:31','2025-11-28 07:23:48',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1764314625696,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"heQIhdIGEf\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[{\"content\":\" Pick &amp; Drop from Delhi Airport/Railway Station.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"English-speaking guide.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Boat ride in Varanasi\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Rickshaw ride in Chandni Chowk.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Battery van ride in Agra.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Elephant Ride in Jaipur.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Chokhi Dhani Visit with Dinner.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Sightseeing in a private air-conditioned vehicle is included as per the itinerary.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"1 pack