; devotion. Witness the patriotic fervor at the Wagah Border ceremony. This tour beautifully weaves together history, faith, and tradition, offering a surreal once-in-a-lifetime experience.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-15 07:22:28','2025-11-15 07:22:28',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1763191348060,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"f7uwPI6Lfd\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[{\"content\":\"Pick &amp; Drop from Delhi Airport/Railway Station.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"English-speaking guide in Delhi, Agra &amp; Jaipur only.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Rickshaw ride in Chandni Chowk.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Battery van ride in Agra.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Elephant Ride in Jaipur.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Chokhi Dhani Visit with Dinner.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Sightseeing in a private air-conditioned vehicle is included as per the itinerary.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"1 packed water bottle of 500 ml per person.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Driverâ€™s allowance, toll parking, road tax, and fuel charges are all included.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"All taxes and fees are included in the package; any other tax levied by the government shall be extra.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]}]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1763191348060,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"C9qmwaeUu1\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Not Available\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763191348060,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"9sfrZ6rq-s\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[{\"content\":\"All flight or train tickets.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Tips for drivers\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Monument entrance fees during sightseeing.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Any unforeseen events such as change in schedule, c