ing\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Lunch and dinner except as mentioned in the inclusion.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Tips for drivers.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Liability for change in itinerary due to reasons beyond our control, like change in schedule.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Cancellation of flights/trains/political disturbances, natural phenomena, etc.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Any other item not specified in the package inclusions.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]}]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}'),(62,85,'Karnataka Kaleidoscope: From City Lights to Cloud-Kissed Heights - FAQ','{\"time\":1763297839318,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"_sDlPIpYve\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Routing:</b> Bangalore-Mysore-Ooty-Bangalore<br><br>\"}},{\"id\":\"ffbrAKdPx1\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Duration:</b> 07 Nights 08 Days<br><br>\"}},{\"id\":\"3ctYbv3oPx\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Tour Overview:</b> Embark on a journey through the vibrant heart of South India with our Karnataka Kaleidoscope Tour. Visit the vibrant city of Bangalore and enjoy its modern charm with lush boulevards. As the journey continues, delve into the magic of Mysore and Ooty, from grand palaces to misty hills. Conclude your journey in Bangalore, cherishing the blend of nature, heritage, and modern charm that makes Karnataka truly one of a kind.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-16 12:57:19','2025-11-16 12:57:19',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1763297839318,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"SZyaf89dEd\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[{\"content\":\"Pick &amp; Drop from the Airport\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Accommodation in all the destinations.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Breakfast Included.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"English-speaking guide.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Toy train tickets.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Sightseeing&nbsp;in a private air-conditioned vehicle is included as per the itinerary.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Cover the sightseeing or places as per the time availability.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"1 bottle of packaged water per person per day during the tour (500 ml).\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Driverâ€™s allowance, toll parking, road tax, fuel charges&nbsp;\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"All currently applicable&nbsp;taxes are included; however, any other tax levied by the government shall be extra.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]}]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1763297839318,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"lFTsl-R3Ek\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Not Available\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763297839318,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"Io_a6iBPzM\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[{\"content\":\"Any air and train fare.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"A sumptuous South Indian lunch in Cochin.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Monument entrance fees during sightseeing\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Lunch and dinner except as mentioned in the inclusion.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Tips for drivers.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Liability for change in itinerary due to reasons beyond our control, like change in schedule.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Cancellation of flights/trains/political disturbances, natural phenomena, etc.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Any other item not specified in the package inclusions.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]}]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}'),(63,86,'Whispers of the Jungle: Jim Corbett National Park Escape - FAQ','{\"time\":1763298402470,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"viUK_jmPFY\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Routing:</b> Delhi-Jim Corbett-Delhi<br><br>\"}},{\"id\":\"hVS-FohAAp\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Duration:</b> 02Nights 03 Days<br><br>\"}},{\"id\":\"YMG3i2qliv\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Tour Overview:</b> Step into the kingdom of wilderness with TrippyJiffy\'s 2-night &amp; 3-dayperfect getaway for nature lovers and adventure seekers. Nestled in the foothills of the Himalayas, lying in the lap of nature surrounded by lush green forests Jim Corbett is India\'s oldest and most visited wildlife sanctuary; it shelters some of India\'s renowned wildlife species and inherits a rich biodiversity and scenic landscapes. Enjoy the thrilling jeep safaris, and if you\'re lucky, witness the majestic beauty of Bengal tigers. The safari will take you through dense forests, riverine belts, and grassy meadows as you witness elephants, deer, and exotic birds. Unwind at your resort amidst the soothing sounds of the jungle and the whispering breeze of the Kosi River, a rejuvenating retreat where adventure meets serenity.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-16 13:06:42','2025-11-16 13:06:42',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1763298402470,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"Zi1ywrNldk\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[{\"content\":\"Pick &amp; Drop from the Airport\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Accommodation in all the destinations.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"All meals included&nbsp;\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Guided Naturalist\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Safari on a sharing basis.&nbsp;\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Cover the sightseeing or places as per the time availability.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"&nbsp;1 Bottle of packaged water per person per day during the tour (500 ml)\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Driverâ€™s allowance, toll parking, road tax, fuel charges.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"All currently applicable&nbsp;taxes are included; however, any other tax levied by the government shall be extra.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]}]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1763298402470,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"wniXOJ2g1P\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Not Available\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763298402470,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"-M6PbvBsTi\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[{\"content\":\"Any air and train fare.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Lunch and dinner except as mentioned in the inclusion.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Tips for drivers.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Liability for change in itinerary due to reasons beyond our control, like change in schedule.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Cancellation of flights/trains/political disturbances, natural phenomena, etc.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Any other item not specified in the package inclusions.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]}]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}'),(64,87,'Ranthambore Safari Experienceâ€”2 Nights Ranthambore Tour - FAQ','{\"time\":1763364854044,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"R8eCQNrPT0\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Routing:</b> Delhi - Ranthambore-Delhi\"}},{\"id\":\"aKNao0RCje\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Duration:</b> 02Nights 03 Days\"}},{\"id\":\"1_WUqgTr2D\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Tour Overview:</b> Embark on a journey to witness the wild heart of Rajasthan come alive. Experience an unforgettable journey with Ranthambore\'s Safari Experience for 2 nights &amp; 3 days. Enjoy the thrilling experience of jeep safaris through the dense forests and open meadows as you spot tigers, leopards, deer, and a rich variety of birdlife. Ranthambore is a UNESCO World Heritage Site; it also offers a beautiful panoramic landscape perfect for this short, relaxing getaway.\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','2025-11-16 13:10:57','2025-11-17 07:34:17',NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1763364854044,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"M9cNKPqn-7\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[{\"content\":\"Pick &amp; Drop from the Airport\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"&nbsp;Accommodation in all the destinations.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"All meals included&nbsp;\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Guided Naturalist\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Safari on a sharing basis.&nbsp;\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Cover the sightseeing or places as per the time availability.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"&nbsp;1 Bottle of packed water per person per day during the tour (500 ml)\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Driverâ€™s allowance, toll parking, road tax, fuel charges.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"All currently applicable&nbsp;taxes are included; however, any other tax levied by the government shall be extra.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]}]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"time\":1763364854044,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"Sn8VOPo4Er\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Not Available\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}','{\"time\":1763364854044,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"m40s9RWKfy\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[{\"content\":\"Any air and train fare.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Lunch and dinner except as mentioned in the inclusion.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Tips for the driver.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Liability for change in itinerary due to reasons beyond our control, like change in schedule.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Cancellation of flights/trains/political disturbances, natural phenomena, etc.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]},{\"content\":\"Any other item not specified in the package inclusions.\",\"meta\":{},\"items\":[]}]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.0-rc.7\"}');
